# CPU-profile-v1 prospective launch review

## Verdict

**Approve one bounded native-only CPU-profile diagnostic launch** with the exact bindings below. The repaired outer sequence now guards freshness of the profile output before source activation. This is not native acceptance, compiler adoption, semantic repair, parity closure, or a performance result. No compiler, collector, hook, or activation ran for this review.

