The compiler is `3c77f2dc8130d386bde12e4547d7e1ace77ff8740cbcceb140aa88574f0dbacc`, patch `76df97d1ac2b9d9e535064941ea78c5117fd26e9e62d50b150427d53c46418de`, based on postpass `0438756db603acb9c46bb002950012a871d261381e0644cb6a1563f2a1ab619c`. The native plan is `3c4e528f65c28e4e300a19847aa6ed9ea61b5300856b8833ad6208c2e90003b2`; outer plan `d2b38df346e22508a9bba8ad21c8adbef260ffafb7d27b6b232862bcbf16e291`; guarded outer script `dfdf1beffd849272a3f90b92b2a6861edca9611f3889fe751367fc9e346c6aa9`; source scope `470a0feae9e02a1e2dd19e146df36802ae12c1baf51037d1449a4edbe1ae9f1a`; launch review `4a91142515cfca394bdef1e1aba0233d654d2edf236b7261b4e23337f7d713e1`.

